# What this module vendors from yadgarhq/proto (D70). buf closes the import graph
# itself, so listing taskapi also brings yadgar/task/v1 (for Task and TaskStatus,
# which taskapi.proto imports) and yadgar/common/v1.
#
# Unlike task/PROTO_PATHS, yadgar/task/v1 is NOT listed here as a second explicit
# path. task lists it because task is a CLIENT of TaskDbService and needs the
# service definition itself — an import closure brings only the messages a proto
# references, not a service another proto declares. gateway is a client of
# TaskService only, so the closure already brings everything it needs; a second
# explicit path would just re-export what --path yadgar/taskapi/v1 already
# exports.
yadgar/taskapi/v1
